Connect ESP32 and run: [python -m src.collect_data]
    Repeat this for the letters you want your model to recognize
    Collect multiple independent trials for every letter

Train Random Forest once you have enough labeled data
    [python main.py]
    This loads dataset, splits it, trains RF, evaluates it, and saves the trained model

Test predictions
    [python -m src.predict]
    Loads trained RF and predicts a letter using the example sensor measurements

Git Commands:
    git status
    git add .
    git commit -m "What changed"
    git push

Dummy Test Commands:
    pip install numpy pandas scikit-learn matplotlib joblib pyserial
    python generate_dummy_data.py
    python main.py
    python -m src.predict